code	status	retriable	message	fix
conflict	409	false	That conflicts with the current state.	Reload and try again.
forbidden	403	false	Your role does not allow this.	Ask an owner or admin to do it, or to change your role.
internal	500	false	Halyard could not complete this request.	Contact support with the request id.
invalid	422	false	That request is not valid.	Check the fields and try again.
method_not_allowed	405	false	That method is not allowed here.	
not_found	404	false	That does not exist.	
not_ready	503	true	This service is still starting up.	Try again in a few seconds.
payload_too_large	413	false	That request body is too large.	Send less data.
payment_required	402	false	This organisation is out of credits.	Top up credits to continue.
rate_limited	429	true	Too many requests.	Wait a moment and try again.
timeout	504	true	That took too long.	Try again.
unauthenticated	401	false	You are not signed in.	Sign in and try again.
unavailable	503	true	A service Halyard depends on is unavailable.	Try again shortly.
unsupported_media_type	415	false	That content type is not supported.	Send application/json.
